w(f"  levels 6 to 10 within {f(100 * sce['largest_deviation_of_class3_from_mean_of_2_and_4'], 1)} percent, combined p = {sce['p']:.3f}); the ratio 6 : 4 : 6 has chi-square {sc['10']['chi2_states_6_4_6_2dof']:,.0f}. The internal tier has")
w(f"  1 : {f(d3['value'], 2)} : 1. No count of states describes both tiers.")
