w(f"- EXACT. First attempt on a blank register (72 cases), pair births (1,5) : (2,4) : (3,3) = {rat('5')} at kappa 5, {rat('4')} at kappa 4,")
w(f"  {rat('10')} at kappa 10. The (1,5) birth is allowed at kappa 5 by equality (cost 10 against 5 x 2). The shares depend on the declared")
w('  kappa and cost table.')
w('')
w('Item 3 (fusion and conjugation).')
w(f"- EXACT counts. Screen, level 10: {s10['events_without_moves']:,} events other than moves, {s10['events_violating_the_sum_mod_6']} violate the sum modulo 6, all {s10['channels_allowed_by_the_sum_rule']} channels a twist")
w(f"  allows occur. Conjugate channels have equal counts (chi-square {s10['conjugation_symmetry']['chi2']:.1f} for {s10['conjugation_symmetry']['channel_pairs']} channel pairs).")
w(f"- EXACT counts. Events with three bodies (a + b -> c, c -> a + b): {s10['three_body_events_2to1_and_1to2']:,} = {f(s10['share_of_events_percent'], 1)} percent (screen, level 10); {f(i6['share_of_events_percent'], 1)} percent")
w(f"  (internal tier, level 6). Without a class 3 among the three: {f(s10['share_without_class_3_percent'], 1)} and {f(i6['share_without_class_3_percent'], 1)} percent.")
w('- EXACT. Runs only: the three-body events. Standard Model only: every process of the four singlets of charge class 0 and of the')
